---
// /img/settings.png in window chrome. While the screenshot is missing, a
// stand-in of the SSH tab, after App/Views/SettingsView.swift.
---

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="settings-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="section-head" data-reveal>
      <h2 id="settings-title">Settings get a real&nbsp;window.</h2>
      <p>A popover closes the moment you switch to the browser to create a token. Projects, the ssh setup and the refresh interval live in a window that stays put.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="settings-slot" data-reveal>
      <img
        src="/img/settings.png"
        width="620"
        height="620"
        alt="Rackbar's Settings window, SSH tab: the chosen folder, the two lines for ~/.ssh/config, and a status line."
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
        hidden
        onload="this.hidden=false;this.nextElementSibling.remove()"
        onerror="this.remove()"
      />
      <div
        class="window sm"
        role="img"
        aria-label="Rackbar's Settings window, SSH tab: the chosen folder, the two lines for ~/.ssh/config, and a status line."
      >
        <div class="sm-toolbar" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="lights"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>
          <span class="sm-tabs">
            <span>
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20"><g fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><rect x="3.5" y="3.5" width="17" height="5" rx="1.5" /><rect x="3.5" y="9.5" width="17" height="5" rx="1.5" /><rect x="3.5" y="15.5" width="17" height="5" rx="1.5" /></g></svg>
              Projects
            </span>
            <span class="on">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20"><g fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="4.5" width="18" height="15" rx="2.5" /><path d="M7 10l3 2.5L7 15M12.5 15.5H17" /></g></svg>
              SSH
            </span>
            <span>
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20"><g fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3" /><path d="M12 3v2.5M12 18.5V21M3 12h2.5M18.5 12H21M5.6 5.6l1.8 1.8M16.6 16.6l1.8 1.8M5.6 18.4l1.8-1.8M16.6 7.4l1.8-1.8" /></g></svg>
              General
            </span>
          </span>
        </div>

        <div class="sm-body" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="sm-group">
            <div class="sm-row"><span>Keep an ssh config for every server</span><span class="sm-toggle"></span></div>
          </div>
          <p class="sm-foot">Every server with a public IPv4 becomes <code>ssh &lt;label&gt;/&lt;server&gt;</code> — with tab completion, and in scp, rsync, mosh and everything else that reads ssh's config.</p>

          <p class="sm-h">1 · A folder for Rackbar</p>
          <div class="sm-group">
            <div class="sm-row"><span>Folder</span><code>/Users/you/.ssh/hcloud</code></div>
            <div class="sm-row sm-buttons"><span class="sm-btn">Change Folder…</span><span class="sm-btn">Forget</span></div>
          </div>

          <p class="sm-h">2 · Include it from ~/.ssh/config, once</p>
          <div class="sm-group">
            <div class="sm-row sm-code"><code>Match all<br />Include hcloud/config</code></div>
            <div class="sm-row sm-note">These two lines go at the end of ~/.ssh/config, so your own Host blocks above them win.</div>
          </div>

          <p class="sm-h">Status</p>
          <div class="sm-group">
            <div class="sm-row">
              <span class="sm-status">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="12" height="12"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="6.3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" /><path d="M5.3 8.2l1.8 1.8 3.6-3.8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" /></svg>
                9 hosts · unchanged 9:41
              </span>
              <span class="sm-btn">Sync Now</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
